 hermes_cli/kanban_quota_episode.py            | 33 +++++---
 .../test_kanban_quota_episode_foreign_runs.py | 76 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 100 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_quota_episode_foreign_runs.py

